            {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maggie Harrison Dupré",
              "description": "At Futurism, I've reported extensively on the rise of AI as a cultural and business force shaping the media industry, and more broadly how those dynamics are changing how we all consume and share information and relate to one another. I'm also fascinated by public health policy and ethics, the role of emerging tech in politics and governance — and the powerful people and forces at those intersections — climate change, and the environment.\r\n\r\nMy investigation on Sports Illustrated's use of AI-generated authors with fictional biographies won a 2024 Mirror Award for \"Best Story on Media Coverage ",
